  "glow_from": "Ours: MU draws the shards at a steady BlendMeshLight. The user, 2026-10-03, of the heap by the statue: 'i think yhose crystals has to glow to be with fire'. They breathe with the heap's own light (its emitter, below), at its 3 Hz and 0.12 s, and above a plain draw -- 0.9 to 1.5 -- so the crystal reads as lit from inside by the flame.",
