  "emitters_from": "Ours, marked: MU calls no CreateFire on any castle type and the heap burns only by its added sheet. The user asked for the castle's fire emitters (2026-10-02), then (2026-10-03): 'remove taht fire from cystals, but keep glowing with some emiter' -- so a lamp, light alone with no flames: CreateFire(0)'s warm colour (ZzzEffectFireLeave.cpp:61) from the heap's middle, 0.9 m up, over four tiles, flickering with the shards' glow",
